      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.418701171875,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "optimized, and the potential role of newer agents with good sterilization properties should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
