      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.3988647460938,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "investigated. The effectiveness and safety of preventive treatment for contacts of people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
