      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4385986328125,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with MDR-TB for progression to TB disease will be important to understand",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
