      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.418701171875,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of routine monitoring of liver enzyme levels over education and clinical observation alone for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
