      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4066772460938,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "preventing severe clinical adverse events, with stratification of the evidence by at-risk population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4384155273438,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Programmatic data on maternal and pregnancy outcomes, inclusive of post-natal follow-up of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
